   "install": {
    "title": "Quickstart",
    "html": "<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">uv add langchain\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">from langchain.chat_models import init_chat_model\n\nmodel = init_chat_model(\"openai:gpt-5.5\")\nresult = model.invoke(\"Hello, world!\")\n</code></pre>\n<p>If you're looking for more advanced customization or agent orchestration, check out <a href=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LangGraph</a>, our framework for building controllable agent workflows.</p>\n<p>For an equivalent JS/TS library, check out <a href=\"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langchainjs\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LangChain.js</a>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>[!TIP]\nFor developing, debugging, and deploying AI agents and LLM applications, see <a href=\"https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/home\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">LangSmith</a>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
